  {
   "id": "dream-cage-329222@1",
   "gameId": "dream-cage-329222",
   "displayName": "UPDATE 1",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-02-08T10:54:16.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "As I mentioned, for me, the most important thing in my games is that you have fun with them, that they are understandable, and that they are as terrifying as possible.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I decided to fix the things that, in my opinion, were the most common reasons why you couldn’t fully enjoy them due to a lack of comfort while playing and an unbalanced difficulty level. The things I have fixed are:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The fear level while using the camera is now balanced and doesn’t increase as quickly as before.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Disabled camera animations when picking up batteries, the camera, and other animations that caused uncomfortable gameplay.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Anomaly scanning is now faster to avoid slowing down the gameplay and to make it more fluid.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If there are still any things that bother you or need improvement, let me know on Discord. I’m always active there. I hope this helped, and that you’ll consider leaving a review.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
